    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n43272" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἔτνος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εος</span>, τό, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>thick soup</i> made with pease or beans, <i><span class="en">
				Ar.
				<u>Ach.</u>
				246
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>Ra.</u>
				62
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				506
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
